      "text": "APPLICATION / MODEL BOUNDARY\nGemini never queries Postgres; the application builds its context with SQL. No vector search. Unsupported citations or unreproducible calculations make the answer partial or insufficient. Optional Langfuse traces record model/tool calls when configured.",
